WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.687
Narrator: iGhost sends an AI user to explore
a website. Ada is looking for evidence of
Johan’s work.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.581
I’ve shortened the wait. Here’s Ada’s
replay.

3
00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:16.042
Ada: I'm scrolling down

4
00:00:16.882 --> 00:00:20.082
Okay I can already see two AI related demos

5
00:00:20.802 --> 00:00:23.642
