reviewable

17
00:01:06.662 --> 00:01:07.242
contributions

18
00:01:07.902 --> 00:01:12.282
I'm scrolling down I still want the complete
project list before

19
00:01:12.282 --> 00:01:13.182
I trust the summary

20
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:22.515
Narrator: After exploring the repository and
profile, Ada recommends putting more
implementation evidence directly on the
project cards.

21
00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:29.619
Her findings become a scoped Codex prompt,
ready to review alongside the captured
screens.
